{
  "title": "AI Roleplay & AI Companion Glossary",
  "upload_type": "dataset",
  "description": "<p>An open glossary of 62 AI roleplay and AI companion terms (character cards, greetings, lorebooks, scenarios, story arcs, memory types from context window to saved facts, RAG and long-term memory, character drift, swipes, temperature, system prompts, jailbreaks, SFW/NSFW, age assurance and dere archetypes). Each entry has an original definition, alternative names, an example, related terms and source URLs. Provided as CSV, JSON and schema.org DefinedTermSet JSON-LD.</p>",
